.TH RECT_CONTAINS 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
rect_contains \- Whether point p lies inside r
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqcollide.h\(dq
.BI "bool rect_contains(Rect r, Vec2 p);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Whether point p lies inside r. Mouse over a button: rect_contains(button, v2(in\->mouse_x, in\->mouse_y)); a point in a trigger; a tile center inside a room.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
true if p is inside r.
.SH MODULE
math (src/engine/math/collide.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rect_overlaps (3),
.BR mouse_pressed (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
